meta {
  name: Get IMDb Ratings
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{API_URL}}/tmdb/imdb-ratings?tmdbIds=348,679
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  tmdbIds: 348,679
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{CLERK_TOKEN}}
}

docs {
  Get IMDb ratings and vote counts for several films at once, keyed by TMDb ID.

  Requires CLERK_TOKEN (returns 401 without it).

  Query Parameters:
  - tmdbIds: up to 100 comma-separated TMDb movie IDs - REQUIRED

  For each film, the IMDb ID comes from the database when the film is in the
  collection, otherwise from TMDb. The rating and votes come live from OMDb
  (www.omdbapi.com), which is unofficial, so figures can differ slightly from
  imdb.com. Nothing is stored.

  Each value in data is one of:
  - { imdbId, imdbRating, imdbVotes }: the figures, with imdbRating and
    imdbVotes null when IMDb has none, and imdbId null when TMDb has no IMDb ID
  - null: that film's lookup failed or ran out of time; the others are unaffected

  Lookups run 10 at a time within a 20-second budget. Returns 400 for missing,
  invalid or more than 100 IDs.

  Example Response:
  {
    "data": {
      "348": { "imdbId": "tt0078748", "imdbRating": 8.5, "imdbVotes": 1012345 },
      "679": null
    }
  }
}
